{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"62dc4664-21a5-4fb9-9a14-aa100c4984c8","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The fixes for the unit test failures have been applied:\n\n1. **`editMesh.test.ts`**: Switched `fc.float` constraints to `fc.double` to satisfy fast-check v4 numeric bounds without throwing.\n2. **`dirty.ts`**: Separated `topologyChangedSinceFlush` from `cacheNeedsRebuild` so that initial `toTrianglesIncremental` cache-warming preserves the `fullReupload === true` signal for `flushRanges()`.\n3. **`editMesh.ts`**: Keyed edges by permanent immutable vertex IDs (`v.id`) rather than variable array indices, rejected incompatible windings in `dissolveEdge` (`return null`), and cleanly unlinked and scrubbed loop references in removed faces so radial cycles and loop invariants never leak.\n\nHandoff file written:\n- [B2-013.fix1.handoff.md](file:///Users/pranav/Project%20Folder/WebAPPBuilder/DOCS/3D/tasks/B2-013.fix1.handoff.md)\n","duration_seconds":6441.036281,"num_turns":2,"usage":{"input_tokens":459402,"output_tokens":147213,"thinking_tokens":91451,"cache_read_tokens":6375888,"total_tokens":606615}}}
